It started from PodOne, a Rockbox theme by Guillaume Cocatre-Zilgien (CC BY-SA), whose credit is kept in
the skin files. The skin, icons, logo and screens were redrawn for RPod by remigius-labs.

Fonts are not included: the theme uses the Terminus and Nimbus fonts from the Rockbox font pack.
